{"id":"a6d94737d6a53725","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-forcing-proper-forcing-axiom-instance.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Proper Forcing Axiom Instance","display":"df-zfc-forcing-proper-forcing-axiom-instance — ZFC Forcing Proper Forcing Axiom Instance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-proper-forcing-axiom-instance","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-proper-forcing-axiom-instance"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-proper-forcing-axiom-instance — ZFC Forcing Proper Forcing Axiom Instance","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-proper]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-proper-forcing-axiom-instance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-proper-forcing-axiom-instance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-proper-forcing-axiom-instance — ZFC Forcing Proper Forcing Axiom Instance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"58-df-proper\">58-df-proper</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ad1cb778dd1ba8fe\" href=\"?note=ad1cb778dd1ba8fe\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter\">58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal D,G\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal D,G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> (order-explicit proper-forcing predicate and membership language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"58-df-proper\">58-df-proper</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S\\)</span> (order-explicit dense-set-meeting filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ad1cb778dd1ba8fe\" href=\"?note=ad1cb778dd1ba8fe\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter\">58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingProperForcingAxiomInstance}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingProperForcingAxiomInstance}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}proper\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}instance} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingProperForcingAxiomInstance}_S(\\mathbb{P},\\mathcal{D}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)\\land |\\mathcal{D}|\\leq\\aleph_1\\land\\exists\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\land\\exists G\\;\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S(G,\\mathcal D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}proper\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}instance} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingProperForcingAxiomInstance}_S(\\mathbb{P},\\mathcal{D}) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb P)\\land |\\mathcal{D}|\\leq\\aleph_1\\land\\exists\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\land\\exists G\\;\\mathrm{DenseSetMeetingFilterStructure}_S(G,\\mathcal D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is one PFA instance: for a proper poset and at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_1\">\\(\\aleph_1\\)</span> specified dense sets, a filter meeting every member of the family exists.</li>\n<li>Properness, density, and the filter now use one shared order; the two former existential projections could silently choose different orders on the same carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-proper","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-proper]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-dense-set-meeting-filter","status":"resolved","id":"ad1cb778dd1ba8fe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"",